  "title": "Frozen Strawberry Squares",
  "description": "This frozen strawberry squares recipe with walnut crust is the perfect summer treat for a warm evening. Serve it with whipped topping and strawberries.",
  "authors": [
    "P. Tindall"
  ],
  "date_published": "1997-08-14T13:53:08-04:00",
